<title>USA: Page America in default of bank payments.</title>
<headline>Page America in default of bank payments.</headline>
<dateline>HACKENSACK, N.J. 1996-12-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Page America Group Inc said on Tuesday it is in default in the payment of all amounts due under its bank credit agreement.</p>
<p>The company said under the agreement, which matured Nov. 30, Page America borrowed $34 million.</p>
<p>The paging company said it expects its deal to sell its assets to Metrocall Inc to close during the first quarter of 1997.</p>
</text>
